## How to Test
1.  Go to **Admin > Pokémon/Magic/Lorcana/One Piece Inventory**.
2.  Choose the filter: **"💎 -- Show My Entire Stocked Inventory --"**.
3.  You will now see a clean list where every card clearly identifies which set it belongs to!
